{"id":"vblizi","lemma":"вблизи","pos":"prep","rank":4388,"glosses":["around, near"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/41/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы живём вблизи школы.","en":"We live near the school.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null,{"g":"school","l":"школа"}]},{"text":"Они изучили их вблизи.","en":"They studied them closely.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to learn, to study","l":"изучить"},{"g":"them / their"},null]},{"text":"Не используйте этот аппарат вблизи воды.","en":"Don't use this apparatus near water.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to use, to apply","l":"использовать"},{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"apparatus"},null,{"g":"water","l":"вода"}]},{"text":"Вблизи нашей школы есть автобусная остановка.","en":"There is a bus stop near our school.","words":[null,{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"school","l":"школа"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,{"g":"stop, pause"}]},{"text":"Вблизи моего дома находятся несколько церквей.","en":"There are several churches near my house.","words":[null,{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"at home"},{"g":"to be found","l":"находиться"},{"g":"somewhat"},null]}]}